<p>President Trump said the United States &quot;does not have to be there for NATO&quot; and criticized European allies for not providing material support to the U.S. as Washington neared the fourth week of its war with Iran. The remarks, delivered at an investment forum in Miami on March 27, raised fresh questions about U.S. commitment to NATO&#x27;s mutual-defense framework as the conflict with Iran continued and U.S. casualties rose. At the same time, allies were looking for answers about what Washington plans to do next. G7 partners pressed U.S. Secretary of State Marco Rubio for clarity on U.S. strategy toward Iran as he tried to persuade skeptical counterparts to back the war, according to the reports. Trump also said talks to end the war were making progress, suggesting diplomacy had not been abandoned even as the military campaign and alliance strains deepened.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/_pCp9EHUb95-ymGzBFZ92tE-WuXVG018nHfOMxEsYDz43hdPvegaTbb-AHWnI3LoWf0wyWsX0SQgwqvnraSue1YR8k_qktgSRYLL10_gRiKPB-UcPT4cT-w7hUD0o63ZT52ka9pGEDgEKaBuin0ljuvd6YPQVf6rsiXSflIPPxvtfl5FJHKpEkdOihsHnlzhh8d5BKiEHKye7CKeBBZt9O_KmRpvXI0cGomD-spuyUftH7xIPDUD3O6H' alt='G7 foreign ministers meeting as allies seek clarity on U.S. plans toward Iran.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Non-NATO war linkage: Trump centered his complaint on Europe&#x27;s lack of material support in the Iran war, tying a NATO debate to help in an active Middle East conflict rather than to a direct attack on an ally.</li><li>Message clash: Trump&#x27;s public criticism of allies came as Rubio met G7 counterparts and tried to sell the U.S. approach on Iran to skeptical partners, creating a split-screen between White House rhetoric and allied diplomacy.</li><li>Israel dimension: The Hindu reported that Trump complained NATO countries were not stepping up to help both the U.S. and Israel in the Iran war, broadening his grievance beyond support for Washington alone.</li></ul><blockquote>We don&#x27;t have to be there for NATO - President Donald Trump</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>President Donald Trump: Trump framed the issue as a burden-sharing dispute during wartime, arguing that European NATO countries had not materially supported Washington in the Iran conflict and that U.S. backing for the alliance should not be taken for granted. (<a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/03/trump-says-we-dont-have-be-there-nato'>Al-Monitor</a>)</li><li>G7 allies: G7 partners pressed Rubio for a clearer sense of Washington&#x27;s endgame in Iran, reflecting concern about how far the war could spread and what the U.S. planned to do next. (<a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/us-secretary-of-state-rubio-tries-to-sell-iran-war-to-sceptical-g7-partners-after-trump-insults-allies/article70792099.ece'>The Hindu</a>)</li><li>U.S. administration: Trump said talks to end the war were making progress even as U.S. casualties mounted, signaling that Washington was keeping a negotiating track open in public alongside the military campaign. (<a href='https://www.rferl.org/a/trump-nato-iran-war-casualties-saudi-rubio/33718562.html'>Radio Free Europe/Radio Liberty</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/iran-war-donald-trump-slams-nato-allies-over-iran-war-support-11276981#publisher=newsstand'>&quot;We Don&#x27;t Have To Be There For NATO&quot;: Trump Slams Allies Over Iran War</a> - ndtv.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/us-secretary-of-state-rubio-tries-to-sell-iran-war-to-sceptical-g7-partners-after-trump-insults-allies/article70792099.ece'>G7 allies press U.S. Secretary of State Rubio on U.S. Iran plans</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.rferl.org/a/trump-nato-iran-war-casualties-saudi-rubio/33718562.html'>Trump Blasts NATO For Failing To Help In Iran War, While US Casualties Grow</a> - rferl.org</li><li><a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/03/trump-says-we-dont-have-be-there-nato'>Trump says &#x27;we don&#x27;t have to be there for NATO&#x27;</a> - al-monitor.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/europe/trump-says-we-dont-have-to-be-there-for-nato'>Trump says ‘we don’t have to be there for NATO’</a> - straitstimes.com</li></ul>